  "video_id": "GSqSpmpFo04",
  "title": "Claude can now edit your videos inside Premiere Pro",
  "description": "Adobe built an official connector that links Claude to Creative Cloud, so you can describe an edit in plain English and it carries it out: cut the silences, add captions in a set style, pull the best thirty seconds for a reel. One chat reaches Premiere, Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign, Lightroom and Firefly. Plus the built-in Premiere setting that deletes every pause straight out of the transcript, which most editors have never opened.\n\nGet the full setup guide here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ZNNYfnQax3ucVVqQVlifYboetYobO0t0Yxv16MKBxx4/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#Shorts #PremierePro #ClaudeAI",
